+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Theorem 3.3 reduces the closed nonzero-modular condition on "
+        "the generated regular graph to proper colouring, and packed Gaussian "
+        "elimination recovers the character in O(r*d^2) bit operations; final "
+        "shipping-preset wall-clock and operation measurements are filled from "
+        "selftest before release, while the Kronecker route uses under 300 exact "
+        "binary operations."
